      "summaries": {
        "en": "Fish Speech is an open-source text-to-speech system that generates natural-sounding speech from text, addressing the need for accessible high-quality voice synthesis. It combines VQ-VAE for discrete speech representation with transformer-based language modeling, enabling efficient and expressive speech generation. Developers can use it to create custom voices, integrate into applications, or experiment with multilingual TTS by fine-tuning on specific datasets.",
        "zh": "Fish Speech 是一个开源文本转语音系统，通过生成自然流畅的语音，解决了高质量语音合成工具的可及性问题。其技术核心在于结合 VQ-VAE 的离散语音表示与基于 Transformer 的语言建模，实现了高效且富有表现力的语音生成。用户可通过微调特定数据集来创建个性化语音、集成到应用程序中，或探索多语言语音合成实验，为语音交互应用提供灵活的技术基础。",
        "es": "Fish Speech is an open-source text-to-speech system that generates natural-sounding speech from text, addressing the need for accessible high-quality voice synthesis. It combines VQ-VAE for discrete speech representation with transformer-based language modeling, enabling efficient and expressive speech generation. Developers can use it to create custom voices, integrate into applications, or experiment with multilingual TTS by fine-tuning on specific datasets.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "fish-speech stands out for llama, transformer, and tts in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Fish Speech is an open-source text-to-speech system that generates natural-sounding speech from text, addressing the need for accessible high-quality voice synthesis. It combines VQ-VAE for discrete speech representation with transformer-based language modeling, enabling efficient and expressive speech generation. Developers can use it to create custom voices, integrate into applications, or experiment with multilingual TTS by fine-tuning on specific datasets.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/fishaudio/fish-speech for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
