      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "AstrBot is an open-source agentic chatbot infrastructure that enables AI assistants to operate across multiple instant messaging platforms like Discord and Telegram. Its technical strength lies in modular architecture that cleanly separates platform adapters, LLM backends, and plugin systems, allowing developers to mix-and-match components. You can deploy it via Docker to create custom AI agents that respond to messages, execute tasks through plugins, and switch between different LLMs like GPT or Llama based on your needs.",
        "zh": "AstrBot是一个开源的多平台智能聊天机器人框架，它让AI助手能够同时在Discord、Telegram等多种即时通讯工具中运行。其核心设计采用模块化架构，将平台适配器、大语言模型后端和插件系统清晰分离，开发者可以像搭积木一样组合不同组件。通过Docker部署后，你可以创建自定义的AI代理，让它在群聊中自动回复消息、通过插件执行具体任务，并根据场景灵活切换GPT或Llama等不同的大模型后端，实现跨平台的自动化助手解决方案。",
        "es": "AstrBot is an open-source agentic chatbot infrastructure that enables AI assistants to operate across multiple instant messaging platforms like Discord and Telegram. Its technical strength lies in modular architecture that cleanly separates platform adapters, LLM backends, and plugin systems, allowing developers to mix-and-match components. You can deploy it via Docker to create custom AI agents that respond to messages, execute tasks through plugins, and switch between different LLMs like GPT or Llama based on your needs.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "AstrBot stands out for agent, ai, and chatbot in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "AstrBot is an open-source agentic chatbot infrastructure that enables AI assistants to operate across multiple instant messaging platforms like Discord and Telegram. Its technical strength lies in modular architecture that cleanly separates platform adapters, LLM backends, and plugin systems, allowing developers to mix-and-match components. You can deploy it via Docker to create custom AI agents that respond to messages, execute tasks through plugins, and switch between different LLMs like GPT or Llama based on your needs.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/AstrBotDevs/AstrBot for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
